{
  "uid": "system-hr-observabilidad",
  "title": "System_HR - Observabilidad del Ecosistema",
  "description": "Estado de salud y Golden Signals de los siete microservicios. Reto 8: Observabilidad y Monitoreo.",
  "tags": [
    "system-hr",
    "reto-8",
    "observabilidad"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Resumen del Sistema",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Estado de los servicios",
      "description": "up vale 1 si Prometheus consiguio raspar el servicio y 0 si no. Es la senal mas barata y la mas importante: si un servicio no esta en prometheus.yml no aparece aqui, y su caida pasa desapercibida.",
      "id": 2,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "up{job!=\"prometheus\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "CAIDO",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "ARRIBA",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "SIN DATOS"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Servicios arriba",
      "description": "Cuantos de los 7 microservicios responden al scraping.",
      "id": 3,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(up{job!=\"prometheus\"})",
          "legendFormat": "arriba",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 7
              }
            ]
          },
          "max": 7,
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tasa de error 5xx (gateway)",
      "description": "Porcentaje de respuestas 5xx en el API Gateway. Se mide en el borde porque es la perspectiva del cliente: un 500 interno que el gateway resuelve con un fallback no es un error para quien llama. El SLO es < 1%; la alerta se dispara por encima del 10%.",
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-gateway\", status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-gateway\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx %",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Comportamiento del Trafico (Golden Signals)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 10,
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Trafico: peticiones por segundo",
      "description": "Segunda Golden Signal. Dos consultas porque Micrometer (Java) y prom-client (Node) nombran la metrica distinto.",
      "id": 11,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} (java)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_requests_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} (node)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia media por servicio",
      "description": "Primera Golden Signal: suma de duraciones dividida por numero de peticiones. La media esconde las colas, por eso al lado esta el p95.",
      "id": 12,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_sum[1m])) / sum by (job) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} (java)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_sum[1m])) / sum by (job) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} (node)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errores HTTP 4xx y 5xx",
      "description": "Tercera Golden Signal. Separar 4xx de 5xx importa: un 4xx suele ser el cliente pidiendo algo invalido (y el sistema rechazandolo bien), mientras que un 5xx es culpa nuestra. Ventana de 5m y no de 1m porque los errores son escasos: rate() necesita al menos dos muestras en la ventana, y con 1m un error puntual no aparece.",
      "id": 13,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{status=~\"[45]..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}} (java)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"[45]..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}} (node)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p95 por servicio",
      "description": "Percentil 95 calculado con histogram_quantile sobre los baldes del histograma. Es la metrica honesta: dice que experiencia tiene el 5% peor, mientras la media puede verse bien con un 5% de usuarios sufriendo.",
      "id": 14,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (job, le) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} (java)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (job, le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} (node)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Saturacion de recursos",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "id": 20,
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU del proceso",
      "description": "Cuarta Golden Signal. Los dos runtimes publican la metrica con nombres distintos: process_cpu_usage en la JVM, process_cpu_seconds_total en Node.",
      "id": 21,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "process_cpu_usage{job!=\"prometheus\"} * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} (java)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "rate(process_cpu_seconds_total{job!=\"prometheus\"}[1m]) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} (node)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memoria en uso",
      "description": "Heap de la JVM y heap de Node. Un crecimiento sostenido sin bajadas apunta a una fuga; los dientes de sierra son la recoleccion de basura trabajando con normalidad.",
      "id": 22,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 25
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (job) (jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} (java)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "nodejs_heap_size_used_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} (node)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
